    "scenesThatPass": [
      "JOY: Mom, wait.\nEVELYN: \"Wait. Wait.\" Today, no time for wait.",
      "EVELYN: Next time I give you rest with interest. You will need it. Actors are very poor-\nJOY: MOM!\nEVELYN EVELYN: 爸！你落嚟做咩啊? Baba! How did you get down here?",
      "DEIRDRE: Mrs. Wang, are you with us right now?\nEVELYN: Of course. I am here. Just thinking.\nDEIRDRE: I asked if you could explain this?\nEVELYN EVELYN: It is a receipt. My receipt. It is a receipt. My receipt. 我們在説什麽？ What are we talking about?",
      "DEIRDRE: I was just hoping you could enlighten me on how, as a laundromat owner, a karaoke machine would constitute a business expense?\nEVELYN: I am a singer.\nDEIRDRE: What?",
      "DEIRDRE: Mrs. Wang... Hello?\nDEIRDRE: Mrs. Wang, I’m sure you have a lot on your mind, but I cannot imagine anything mattering more than this conversation we are having right now…\nEVELYN: I know. I am paying attention.\nDEIRDRE: You think I'm stupid."
    ]
  },
